Description:
    Loads local settings from a .env.local file with the dotenv gem,
    and adds EnvValue to read typed settings from ENV.

Example:
    rails generate rolemodel:dotenv

    This will create:
        lib/env_value.rb
        spec/lib/env_value_spec.rb (when the app has a spec folder)

    This will change:
        Gemfile (adds dotenv to the development and test groups)
        config/application.rb (requires lib/env_value, warns about a leftover .env_overrides.rb)
        config/database.yml (reads DB_HOST, DB_PORT, POSTGRES_USER and POSTGRES_PASSWORD)
        .gitignore (ignores /.env*)
